<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-display-lg md:font-display-lg text-on-surface">Community Care</h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl">
                Discover off-platform specialists who uphold our sanctuary standards. Each provider is strictly vetted for zero-record privacy and empathetic excellence.
            </p>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Search & Filters -->
